  <item>
    <title>vol 04：猫猫狗狗拯救世界！i人在海滨小城的咸鱼生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668546110bc5d7cc7092869f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668546110bc5d7cc7092869f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 12:37:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客搭子：白露</span></p><span></span><p><span>“现在是我最好的可以去死的时候”——这是我最近听过最有松弛感的话了，因为发言者是放松的轻快的心态，因为她热爱生活。这期在海边录制，背景音是海浪拍岸的声音~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a> &nbsp;一猫一狗一人的海滨小镇生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> &nbsp;三分冷酷、三分嘲讽、四分不羁的小猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a> &nbsp;养宠物后的生活变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> &nbsp;晒娃，爬树和受伤的drama时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> &nbsp;美少女妮露！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> &nbsp;养狗之后的社交生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> &nbsp;从养狗到养娃的小小反思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">16:14</a> &nbsp;一场关于宠物的“脱敏治疗”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a> &nbsp;不敢养宠物的心理探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 从宝石设计到遥感专业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> “不孝有三，无编为大”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1594">26:34</a> 两种家庭环境下的亲情观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1756">29:16</a> 《老友记》和Monica</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> 向往的咸鱼生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 养宠物后的社交生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 宠物带来的幸福感和生命力</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《大海》南西肯恩</span></p><span></span><p><span>《爱人错过》告五人</span></p><span></span><p><span>《偶阵雨》梁静茹</span></p>]]></description>
