  <item>
    <title>vol 03：没有朋友就在路上捡朋友！独自旅行的奇妙时刻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66852aa40bc5d7cc708cb4ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66852aa40bc5d7cc708cb4ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 10:40:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>分享一次10天6城的独自旅游经历~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 令人疲惫的旅行往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> Gap后旅游心态转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 自由行的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">06:19</a> J人和P人游玩节奏差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="539">08:59</a> 边走边聊，认识新朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 从他人的回忆里认识这个城市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> 在婺源的一次奇妙相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 带着本地人重新认识周边生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1393">23:13</a> 生活在他乡的老朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1609">26:49</a> 改变语言融入他乡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1756">29:16</a> 用美食选择目的地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> 在景德镇疯狂社交的三天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 不同的生活经历让世界变得更立体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a> 开心到要死的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a> 从人的精神状态到城市的面貌</span></p>]]></description>
