  <item>
    <title>vol 02:妈的多重宇宙！谈谈成长中母女关系的流变</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6660183f63c334a2fb85925a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6660183f63c334a2fb85925a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Jun 2024 07:48:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一期由母亲节引发的女生漫谈，本期发散性较强~</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为28岁的女儿，看见当妈妈跳出母亲角色，变成不一样的大人，我们对于家庭、母亲、父亲、女性的认知正在发生变化：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a> 长大后，我和妈妈变成朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 爱上过节的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 总是让人吐槽的爸爸和多面体妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 让人崇拜的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a> 恨铁不成钢的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 重新出发的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a> 看不透的处女座老父亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 崩塌和重构的母女关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1797">29:57</a> 非传统的妈妈也很酷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 东亚家庭的“大家长”和“工具人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a> 《如何阅读德里达》解构母性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> 当妈妈开始催婚……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> 真生病被老爸嫌弃故事一则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2627">43:47</a> 脆弱老爸看病故事一则</span></p>]]></description>
